; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.32 on BTCUSD - rank 3: M10 sell, session 0700-2000 server time, trend filter none. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Backtest Jan 2025-May 2026 (Binance BTCUSDT M1, assumed spread 10 USD, risk-% sizing): 124 trades, PF 2.21, net +44R, max drawdown 3.7R. 2025 worse half-year PF 2.29; 2026 PF 1.86 (39 trades).
; Harsh stress (1 min late, pessimistic trailing, 3 USD slippage, 2 USD commission): PF 2.08; 2025 worse half 2.19; 2026 PF 1.51.
; Chosen with ALL the data: no unseen test. Across the whole BTC search a good 2025 did not predict 2026 (median 2026 PF about 1.0).
; UNPROVEN: Strategy Tester (real ticks) and demo only. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD. MaxSpread_Points=3000 allows a 30 USD spread.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7h). The weekend close is off: BTC trades through the weekend at most brokers.
